+# Sealed delivery note keys
+
+`delivery-public.json` is the dispatch team's **public** X-Wing (ML-KEM-768 + X25519)
+encapsulation key. Browsers fetch it to seal customer notes; it is safe to publish.
+
+The matching **secret** key lives in `keys/private/` (git-ignored). Store it in a
+secrets manager or offline — anyone holding it can read every sealed note.
+
+```sh
+pnpm keys:generate            # first-time setup (use --force to rotate)
+pnpm note:open sealed.txt     # decrypt a note (raw JSON or "DGNOTE1." token)
+```
+
+Scheme (`DG-SEALED-NOTE-v1`): X-Wing KEM → HKDF-SHA-256 (bound to suite, header and
+KEM ciphertext) → AES-256-GCM with the header (version, suite, key id, order ref,
+timestamp) as associated data. A new encapsulation is done for every note.
