+// smallpt, a Path Tracer by Kevin Beason, 2008 — http://www.kevinbeason.com/smallpt/
+// WebAssembly port: the rendering core below is the original smallpt.cpp (with
+// braces added to the Russian-roulette branch so it compiles with -Wall -Werror).
