+            if (lang === 'vi' && /[ơưđạảấầẩẫậắằẳẵặẹẻẽếềểễệỉịọỏốồổỗộớờởỡợụủứừửữựỳỵỷỹ]/i.test(text)) s += 4;
+            if ((lang === 'sv' || lang === 'fi') && /[äö]/i.test(text)) s += 1;
+            if ((lang === 'da' || lang === 'no') && /[æø]/i.test(text)) s += 2;
+            if (lang === 'sv' && /å/i.test(text) && !/[æø]/i.test(text)) s += 1;
+            return { lang, score: s };
+          })
+          .sort((a, b) => b.score - a.score);
+
+        const [best, second] = scores;
+        if (!best || best.score === 0) return null;
+        const margin = best.score - (second ? second.score : 0);
+        const confidence = Math.min(0.95, 0.4 + (best.score / words.length) * 0.5 + margin * 0.05);
+        return { lang: best.lang, confidence };
+      }
+
+      async function builtInDetect(text) {
+        // Chrome's on-device Language Detector API (where supported).
+        if (!('LanguageDetector' in self)) return null;
+        try {
+          const availability = await self.LanguageDetector.availability();
+          if (availability === 'unavailable') return null;
+          const detector = await self.LanguageDetector.create();
+          const [top] = await detector.detect(text);
+          if (!top || top.detectedLanguage === 'und') return null;
+          return { lang: top.detectedLanguage, confidence: top.confidence };
+        } catch {
+          return null;
+        }
+      }
+
+      const form = document.getElementById('feedback-form');
+      const input = document.getElementById('feedback-message');
+      const button = document.getElementById('detect-btn');
+      const result = document.getElementById('detect-result');
+
+      function show(message, detail, isError) {
+        result.textContent = '';
+        const strong = document.createElement('strong');
+        strong.textContent = message;
+        result.appendChild(strong);
+        if (detail) {
+          const small = document.createElement('small');
+          small.textContent = detail;
+          result.appendChild(small);
+        }
+        result.classList.toggle('error', !!isError);
+        result.hidden = false;
+      }
+
+      form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
+        e.preventDefault();
+        const text = input.value.trim();
+        if (!text) {
+          show('Please enter a message first.', null, true);
+          input.focus();
+          return;
+        }
+
+        button.disabled = true;
+        button.textContent = 'Detecting…';
+        try {
+          const detected = (await builtInDetect(text)) || heuristicDetect(text);
+          if (!detected) {
+            show("Sorry, we couldn't identify the language of this message.", 'Try writing a longer message.', true);
+            return;
+          }
+          const pct = Math.round(detected.confidence * 100);
+          show(
+            `Detected language: ${nameOf(detected.lang)}`,
+            `Language code: ${detected.lang} · Confidence: ${pct}%`
+          );
+        } finally {
+          button.disabled = false;
+          button.textContent = 'Detect';
+        }
+      });
+    })();
+  </script>
+
 </body>

 </html>

