+ *   - Requests are sent with `credentials: 'omit'`, `redirect: 'error'`, a
+ *     timeout, and a response-size cap. Responses are rendered as plain text
+ *     only — never as HTML.
+ *   - Requests opt into Chrome's Local Network Access via `targetAddressSpace`,
+ *     so the browser shows its permission prompt and enforces CORS on the target.
+ *   - The optional CLI pairing token is kept in memory only (never persisted).
+ */
