+    <h2>2. Data processed when you visit the site</h2>
+    <p><strong>Server logs.</strong> Like any website, our hosting infrastructure receives technical data necessary to deliver pages (IP address, requested URL, browser user agent, time of request). We use this only to operate and secure the service.</p>
+    <p><strong>No third-party requests by default.</strong> Fonts, images of our own articles and all scripts are served from our own domain. Some article images are loaded from external image hosts (e.g. <code>i.imgur.com</code>); those hosts receive your IP address and, thanks to our referrer policy, only our domain name and not the page you were reading.</p>
